WEBVTT

00:00:02.480 --> 00:00:03.360
I'm sorry.

00:00:03.360 --> 00:00:04.560
I was careless.

00:00:05.020 --> 00:00:08.250
I deployed some personnel in 
the area around this house.

00:00:08.250 --> 00:00:11.530
But they struck when she 
happened to be over here.

00:00:12.400 --> 00:00:14.790
That's the only thing left at the scene.

00:00:14.790 --> 00:00:18.470
They took her while she 
was using the bathroom.

00:00:19.000 --> 00:00:19.830
Because I...

00:00:20.600 --> 00:00:23.180
Because I brought Sana-chan here!

00:00:23.180 --> 00:00:25.320
Oh, no, no... That's not true.

00:00:25.320 --> 00:00:27.050
It isn't your fault.

00:00:27.600 --> 00:00:30.750
Ichijo-kun and a lady named 
"Yamada" are after them now.

00:00:30.750 --> 00:00:32.130
I'm sure they'll find her soon.

00:00:32.410 --> 00:00:34.340
But... But...

00:00:34.340 --> 00:00:35.510
Calm down.

00:00:35.740 --> 00:00:37.200
Don't worry.

00:00:37.200 --> 00:00:38.530
Grandpa...

00:00:38.910 --> 00:00:40.560
She'll be fine.

00:00:41.640 --> 00:00:43.770
Yeah, he's right!

00:00:44.230 --> 00:00:47.440
Sana-chan is valuable 
to those guys, too.

00:00:47.640 --> 00:00:49.750
They won't be quick to harm her.

00:00:50.180 --> 00:00:51.660
Harm her?

00:00:52.100 --> 00:00:53.060
Sanae...

00:01:00.200 --> 00:01:01.290
Do you understand?

00:01:01.510 --> 00:01:03.370
Did you just imagine it now?

00:01:05.370 --> 00:01:08.680
If you struggle or disobey me,

00:01:08.680 --> 00:01:10.240
you will die.

00:01:11.220 --> 00:01:13.450
I would do absolutely anything

00:01:13.930 --> 00:01:16.070
to see him again.

00:02:48.020 --> 00:02:53.020
<b>Something Not Human</b>

00:02:57.070 --> 00:03:00.460
What does everyone like 
about such a noisy place?

00:03:04.160 --> 00:03:05.240
I'm back.

00:03:05.480 --> 00:03:07.200
I want to go home and 
play video games.

00:03:07.580 --> 00:03:08.720
We're done here, right?

00:03:08.720 --> 00:03:09.430
Yes.

00:03:09.430 --> 00:03:11.890
We can leave the rest to Minnie C.

00:03:12.290 --> 00:03:14.630
I'm sure she'll bring 
the Red Queen home.

00:03:15.080 --> 00:03:17.080
You all did great.

00:03:18.880 --> 00:03:21.790
If you get hungry before we get 
there, you can have that—

00:03:21.790 --> 00:03:22.760
I don't want it.

00:03:23.820 --> 00:03:25.640
I'm sick of sweet stuff.

00:03:26.430 --> 00:03:29.510
When this is over, everything will 
be back to normal, right?

00:03:29.510 --> 00:03:31.360
We'll be with Sa-chan again.

00:03:31.930 --> 00:03:32.480
Yes.

00:03:33.630 --> 00:03:34.900
That's right.

00:03:43.500 --> 00:03:45.740
Honestly, you disappoint me.

00:03:46.320 --> 00:03:49.610
You once commanded the 
principles of space itself.

00:03:49.610 --> 00:03:51.670
If this is all you can do outside,

00:03:51.670 --> 00:03:54.310
you really are no more than a child.

00:03:54.890 --> 00:03:56.580
You acquired a body,

00:03:56.580 --> 00:03:57.990
learned language,

00:03:57.990 --> 00:03:59.220
and gained emotions...

00:03:59.220 --> 00:04:03.390
Only to flee to the outside world 
and pretend to be human.

00:04:03.390 --> 00:04:04.180
See?

00:04:04.180 --> 00:04:07.950
It was so easy to render 
you motionless.

00:04:09.270 --> 00:04:11.000
<i>Pretend to be human?</i>

00:04:11.000 --> 00:04:13.520
<i>What is she talking about?</i>

00:04:13.520 --> 00:04:15.020
Or could it be...

00:04:15.810 --> 00:04:18.770
Do you actually think you're human,

00:04:20.440 --> 00:04:22.130
Red Queen?

00:04:23.150 --> 00:04:25.570
Why are they after that girl?

00:04:26.020 --> 00:04:28.370
I called you because I thought you

00:04:28.370 --> 00:04:31.750
could do something about the abuse 
she's apparently endured.

00:04:31.750 --> 00:04:36.630
But it looks like you guys are 
working on something bigger.

00:04:37.540 --> 00:04:39.090
That's a state secret.

00:04:39.090 --> 00:04:39.880
Huh?

00:04:40.210 --> 00:04:41.020
Kidding, kidding!

00:04:41.020 --> 00:04:42.420
A joke.

00:04:42.780 --> 00:04:45.630
This is just something of 
a territorial dispute...

00:04:45.920 --> 00:04:50.460
In the government, two people 
have two differing opinions.

00:04:50.460 --> 00:04:53.560
I'm basically one of those people's dog.

00:04:53.560 --> 00:04:55.890
Say it so I can understand.

00:04:55.890 --> 00:04:58.220
Just what kind of little girl is she?

00:04:59.440 --> 00:05:02.280
To be honest, I'm not 
sure you'll believe me.

00:05:03.010 --> 00:05:05.770
But Sana-chan, most likely,

00:05:05.770 --> 00:05:08.590
isn't a human like you and me.

00:05:08.590 --> 00:05:09.660
Huh?

00:05:10.130 --> 00:05:12.520
You are not human.

00:05:13.390 --> 00:05:14.410
In fact...

00:05:15.130 --> 00:05:16.610
Thirteen years ago,

00:05:16.610 --> 00:05:19.960
when you first appeared beneath 
the research facility,

00:05:19.960 --> 00:05:22.790
you couldn't even be 
called a living thing.

00:05:23.500 --> 00:05:28.170
You were a mere phenomenon that could 
randomly read thoughts and reactions

00:05:28.170 --> 00:05:31.310
of living things around you, 
and make them real.

00:05:31.720 --> 00:05:33.020
Your appearance,

00:05:33.360 --> 00:05:36.390
ego, emotions, and words you learned

00:05:36.390 --> 00:05:38.890
were all cards that an ownerless Mirror Gate

00:05:38.890 --> 00:05:42.430
created by copying those 
things from humans.

00:05:42.430 --> 00:05:43.910
Have you forgotten that?

00:05:43.910 --> 00:05:44.960
<i>That's a lie.</i>

00:05:44.960 --> 00:05:47.680
<i>I'm Sana, and I'm right here!</i>

00:05:47.680 --> 00:05:51.030
That is why you must not leave 
the research facility.

00:05:51.280 --> 00:05:54.290
Living in the outside world 
is impossible for you.

00:05:54.290 --> 00:05:56.850
If there is a place for you in the world,

00:05:56.850 --> 00:05:59.250
it's at Wonderland and nowhere else.

00:05:59.740 --> 00:06:03.210
Now, let us return to where you belong.

00:06:04.150 --> 00:06:08.460
That girl's power is called 
a "Dream of Alice."

00:06:08.460 --> 00:06:13.250
And it's said that soon, many more 
people will have such powers.

00:06:14.060 --> 00:06:16.510
This may all sound preposterous.

00:06:16.510 --> 00:06:21.440
But it flips our senses of vitality 
and ethics totally upside-down.

00:06:21.440 --> 00:06:26.230
Can our society accept beings like her?

00:06:26.230 --> 00:06:29.070
We'll soon be facing that issue head-on.

00:06:29.400 --> 00:06:32.570
Frankly, we think it's possible.

00:06:32.570 --> 00:06:35.340
But the other side doesn't agree...

00:06:35.880 --> 00:06:38.380
Do you understand now?

00:06:38.750 --> 00:06:40.010
More or less.

00:06:40.010 --> 00:06:43.790
We'd been employing various tactics 
beneath the surface already.

00:06:44.110 --> 00:06:49.200
And then we learned the girl we'd been 
watching had wound up with you.

00:06:49.200 --> 00:06:52.720
So I thought I'd make use 
of that little godsend.

00:06:53.170 --> 00:06:54.560
Make use of it?

00:06:55.260 --> 00:07:00.000
Yep, to determine whether humans 
can coexist with Sana-chan.

00:07:00.590 --> 00:07:02.790
Well, I guess that's an exaggeration.

00:07:02.790 --> 00:07:07.540
You've always been the type who doesn't 
consider the trouble you cause others.

00:07:07.540 --> 00:07:08.620
Sorry.

00:07:09.390 --> 00:07:11.660
I'll air my complaints later.

00:07:11.660 --> 00:07:14.070
After that girl comes back home.

00:07:14.730 --> 00:07:17.790
Sanae, can you continue 
to get along with her?

00:07:17.790 --> 00:07:18.570
Huh?

00:07:18.570 --> 00:07:19.670
Y-Yeah.

00:07:19.670 --> 00:07:20.570
All right.

00:07:21.400 --> 00:07:22.970
Then the girl can—

00:07:22.970 --> 00:07:26.040
U-Um, that's fine, but...

00:07:26.350 --> 00:07:31.180
Grandpa, I wish you wouldn't just 
make decisions about everything

00:07:31.640 --> 00:07:33.640
on your own like that.

00:07:34.410 --> 00:07:38.150
When I heard that Sana-chan 
was at our house,

00:07:38.150 --> 00:07:41.900
I was so surprised.

00:07:42.300 --> 00:07:43.980
I mean, it's fine, but...

00:07:43.980 --> 00:07:47.570
But you tend to be that 
way sometimes.

00:07:48.590 --> 00:07:49.620
Do I?

00:07:50.210 --> 00:07:53.970
Please value your family more!

00:07:53.970 --> 00:07:56.580
Please talk to me more!

00:07:57.150 --> 00:08:00.920
If we're going to be a family of 
three, it's all the more reason.

00:08:04.450 --> 00:08:05.370
I'm done.

00:08:05.740 --> 00:08:07.360
Okay...

00:08:07.360 --> 00:08:08.090
Got it.

00:08:08.760 --> 00:08:09.650
Okay.

00:08:09.650 --> 00:08:11.050
I'm glad, then.

00:08:14.110 --> 00:08:16.220
Now, then. Our little chat is over.

00:08:16.610 --> 00:08:19.810
I'll need you to be quiet for a bit longer.

00:08:20.820 --> 00:08:23.060
<i>I'm not human?</i>

00:08:23.060 --> 00:08:26.120
<i>That's why I wasn't to go 
to the outside world?</i>

00:08:26.120 --> 00:08:27.200
<i>Am I...</i>

00:08:27.200 --> 00:08:29.780
<i>Am I not allowed to go anywhere?</i>

00:08:30.470 --> 00:08:32.190
<i>Because I'm a monster?</i>

00:08:32.570 --> 00:08:34.020
<i>I don't...</i>

00:08:34.020 --> 00:08:35.240
<i>I don't</i>

00:08:36.110 --> 00:08:37.030
<i>want that!</i>

00:08:37.290 --> 00:08:39.610
This will just slow your body down,

00:08:39.610 --> 00:08:41.750
to make your brain stop working.

00:08:42.140 --> 00:08:46.250
When you're completely unconscious, 
you're more dangerous.

00:08:49.610 --> 00:08:50.680
Filthy...

00:08:59.530 --> 00:09:01.790
Oh, you've come here?

00:09:02.180 --> 00:09:05.680
It's sort of against the rules 
for you to talk to me.

00:09:06.280 --> 00:09:08.720
I feel like I know you.

00:09:08.720 --> 00:09:09.960
Who are you?

00:09:09.960 --> 00:09:11.220
Me?

00:09:11.220 --> 00:09:13.330
Well... let's see.

00:09:13.330 --> 00:09:16.200
I'm a really cool lady you don't know.

00:09:16.640 --> 00:09:17.480
Huh?

00:09:17.480 --> 00:09:20.740
When I was at the research 
facility, did you talk to me?

00:09:22.440 --> 00:09:24.870
Well, in time, you'll find out.

00:09:25.800 --> 00:09:26.680
Flat.

00:09:26.680 --> 00:09:27.400
Huh?

00:09:27.860 --> 00:09:31.450
You're an adult, but Sanae has 
bigger breasts than you.

00:09:31.450 --> 00:09:33.820
You'd better not forget you said that.

00:09:33.820 --> 00:09:35.550
I'll knock you for a loop later.

00:09:37.710 --> 00:09:38.680
Hey...

00:09:39.430 --> 00:09:42.480
I may not be human.

00:09:42.480 --> 00:09:43.890
I may be a monster.

00:09:44.460 --> 00:09:48.740
Most people don't know 
what they really are.

00:09:49.110 --> 00:09:52.170
I'm still searching for that myself.

00:09:52.840 --> 00:09:55.050
I shouldn't tell you this.

00:09:55.780 --> 00:09:58.800
But I was very lucky.

00:09:59.210 --> 00:10:02.860
I had people around me who 
knew things I didn't.

00:10:03.520 --> 00:10:05.160
I'm sure you do, too.

00:10:05.920 --> 00:10:08.870
You should try calling 
that person's name.

00:10:13.780 --> 00:10:16.170
Hey, did you just hear something?

00:10:16.570 --> 00:10:18.970
Wait! Look above you. Above.

00:10:18.970 --> 00:10:19.870
Huh?

00:10:20.270 --> 00:10:21.450
The hell is that?

00:10:22.180 --> 00:10:24.070
That's Sana-chan's.

00:10:26.410 --> 00:10:27.230
Grandpa!

00:10:27.480 --> 00:10:29.440
Please save Sana-chan!

00:10:29.660 --> 00:10:30.400
Huh?

00:10:31.060 --> 00:10:33.400
<i>Zo... roku.</i>

00:10:37.190 --> 00:10:37.930
Huh?

00:10:51.250 --> 00:10:52.210
Hey!

00:10:54.370 --> 00:10:55.210
Sana...

00:10:55.550 --> 00:10:56.960
Sana, you okay?

00:10:57.360 --> 00:10:58.670
Can you hear me?

00:10:58.670 --> 00:11:00.150
<i>That's...</i>

00:11:00.150 --> 00:11:02.550
<i>That's the first time 
he's called me "Sana."</i>

00:11:02.550 --> 00:11:04.380
Hey, are you the one

00:11:04.380 --> 00:11:07.390
who's been cruel to this little girl?

00:11:07.940 --> 00:11:10.130
Honestly, Red Queen,

00:11:10.130 --> 00:11:11.370
all you do is cause—

00:11:11.370 --> 00:11:13.220
You demon...

00:11:13.220 --> 00:11:14.690
I'm not joking here!

00:11:15.420 --> 00:11:19.950
I hate crooked stuff!

00:11:20.500 --> 00:11:22.950
Just who are you?

00:11:22.950 --> 00:11:24.810
I'm a florist.

00:11:24.810 --> 00:11:27.580
I'm not too strong, 
but I won't be outdone.

00:11:28.100 --> 00:11:29.040
Sana!

00:11:29.340 --> 00:11:31.160
Where's your energy from earlier?

00:11:31.660 --> 00:11:34.540
Can't you do anything, 
just by thinking about it?

00:11:34.540 --> 00:11:37.270
So don't just stay here like this!

00:11:40.050 --> 00:11:41.030
Sana...

00:11:42.420 --> 00:11:44.310
Get back home right now!

00:11:44.310 --> 00:11:49.050
That creepy guy, Naito, 
is gonna save you.

00:11:50.730 --> 00:11:52.740
Don't worry about me.

00:11:52.740 --> 00:11:53.590
Just...

00:11:54.620 --> 00:11:55.960
Get going, now!

00:11:55.960 --> 00:11:57.980
Would you please be quiet?

00:11:57.980 --> 00:11:58.480
You—

00:12:04.930 --> 00:12:05.990
Sana!

00:12:06.510 --> 00:12:08.130
Damn you!

00:12:13.300 --> 00:12:17.710
Red Queen, if you try to act 
on your own again,

00:12:17.710 --> 00:12:19.760
something even worse will happen.

00:12:20.310 --> 00:12:22.030
Next time, to him.

00:12:22.030 --> 00:12:23.090
Sana!

00:12:23.090 --> 00:12:24.380
Understand?

00:12:24.380 --> 00:12:26.150
I am serious.

00:12:26.150 --> 00:12:27.550
Sana. Sana...

00:12:28.060 --> 00:12:29.280
Sana!

00:12:29.280 --> 00:12:30.250
<i>No.</i>

00:12:30.250 --> 00:12:31.720
<i>No more...</i>

00:12:31.720 --> 00:12:34.150
<i>Why did it come to this?</i>

00:12:34.150 --> 00:12:36.710
<i>Because I'm not human?</i>

00:12:37.130 --> 00:12:42.560
<i>Because I pretended to be human when 
I'm not, and I called Zoroku here?</i>

00:12:42.560 --> 00:12:45.280
<i>Or because Zoroku and I...</i>

00:12:47.090 --> 00:12:48.290
<i>I see...</i>

00:12:48.980 --> 00:12:50.040
<i>I get it.</i>

00:13:05.780 --> 00:13:07.040
That's enough.

00:13:08.060 --> 00:13:09.390
I get it now.

00:13:10.050 --> 00:13:13.360
So don't do anything bad to Zoroku.

00:13:15.220 --> 00:13:15.810
Sana!

00:13:16.060 --> 00:13:16.610
Hey!

00:13:16.610 --> 00:13:18.190
Her energy finally ran out.

00:13:18.190 --> 00:13:19.040
Sana...

00:13:19.040 --> 00:13:21.400
Is your wound okay?

00:13:23.000 --> 00:13:24.820
She truly is amazing.

00:13:25.460 --> 00:13:28.530
While making her wound disappear,

00:13:28.530 --> 00:13:31.620
she actually rewrote parts 
of her situation.

00:13:34.580 --> 00:13:36.660
I've located Sana-chan!

00:13:36.660 --> 00:13:39.960
She's headed toward Oi Futo on the 
Shuto Expressway Bayshore Route!

00:13:39.960 --> 00:13:40.960
Got it.

00:13:40.960 --> 00:13:46.000
I'll ask an acquaintance in Port Authority 
if he's seen anyone strange leaving Oi.

00:13:46.000 --> 00:13:47.860
Ichijo-kun, did you hear that?

00:13:47.860 --> 00:13:48.560
<i>Yes!</i>

00:13:48.560 --> 00:13:49.590
<i>I'll head there, too!</i>

00:13:50.020 --> 00:13:51.380
Thanks.

00:13:51.380 --> 00:13:52.670
So there you go.

00:13:52.670 --> 00:13:54.670
Nothing to worry about anymore.

00:13:54.670 --> 00:13:56.100
O-Okay...

00:13:56.470 --> 00:13:58.500
I'm heading out for a bit.

00:13:58.500 --> 00:14:00.840
You should go home, Sanae-chan.

00:14:00.840 --> 00:14:02.520
I'll get someone to take you.

00:14:03.140 --> 00:14:04.360
Wait here.

00:14:20.040 --> 00:14:21.130
Um...

00:14:21.360 --> 00:14:24.380
Could you take me with you?

00:14:34.470 --> 00:14:36.430
I'm sorry, Zoroku.

00:14:36.940 --> 00:14:41.190
I... really am... a monster.

00:14:41.190 --> 00:14:42.190
I'm sorry.

00:14:42.690 --> 00:14:44.750
I'm so sorry, Zoroku.

00:14:45.290 --> 00:14:46.800
Don't worry about it.

00:14:46.800 --> 00:14:48.150
I'm used to it.

00:14:49.160 --> 00:14:50.360
I'm sorry!

00:14:52.910 --> 00:14:56.070
Kashimura Zoroku-san, age 72.

00:14:56.070 --> 00:14:58.770
Owner of the flower shop 
Kashimura Floral.

00:14:59.220 --> 00:15:03.040
Your family consists of a granddaughter, 
a high school second-year.

00:15:04.630 --> 00:15:06.620
You know everything about me, huh?

00:15:07.640 --> 00:15:11.300
I'd appreciate it if you would quietly 
accompany us for a while.

00:15:11.800 --> 00:15:13.760
Who are you, anyway?

00:15:14.290 --> 00:15:17.080
I am Miriam C. Tachibana.

00:15:17.080 --> 00:15:19.630
I'm working with a certain state project

00:15:19.630 --> 00:15:22.520
that involves the Japanese 
and American governments.

00:15:23.120 --> 00:15:25.650
What they call "Dreams of Alice," right?

00:15:25.870 --> 00:15:27.670
Oh, you know of them?

00:15:27.670 --> 00:15:30.730
Our goal is to research 
the Dreams of Alice

00:15:30.730 --> 00:15:33.840
and artificially reproduce their powers.

00:15:33.840 --> 00:15:38.240
And in the end, we'll build a new 
energy system based upon it.

00:15:38.820 --> 00:15:41.670
You could say this is a project 
to benefit humanity.

00:15:41.940 --> 00:15:44.190
You don't mind keeping this 
child locked up for life,

00:15:44.190 --> 00:15:46.280
dissecting her or anything else,

00:15:46.280 --> 00:15:49.170
as long as it's "to benefit humanity"?

00:15:50.520 --> 00:15:52.730
You like sci-fi movies?

00:15:53.250 --> 00:15:55.310
We will not dissect her.

00:15:55.310 --> 00:15:56.430
However...

00:15:57.230 --> 00:16:01.180
She is not a human, let alone a child.

00:16:02.600 --> 00:16:04.240
The Red Queen is an

00:16:04.240 --> 00:16:09.710
unknown phenomenon, born when an 
unidentified being mimicked humans.

00:16:09.710 --> 00:16:10.400
Hmph!

00:16:10.400 --> 00:16:11.880
Makes no sense to me.

00:16:11.880 --> 00:16:14.110
She looks like an ordinary little girl.

00:16:14.110 --> 00:16:17.480
What if a weapon of mass destruction 
adopted an artificial personality,

00:16:17.480 --> 00:16:19.570
taking the form of a young girl?

00:16:20.850 --> 00:16:23.270
What would you think about that?

00:16:23.270 --> 00:16:24.080
Huh?

00:16:24.310 --> 00:16:25.860
Such a monster is attempting

00:16:25.860 --> 00:16:29.550
to mingle in our society, in disguise.

00:16:29.550 --> 00:16:30.540
Hey...

00:16:30.540 --> 00:16:33.160
Kashimura-san, since meeting her,

00:16:33.160 --> 00:16:36.640
have you or your granddaughter 
been in mortal danger?

00:16:36.640 --> 00:16:39.120
Don't listen to a word she says!

00:16:39.120 --> 00:16:41.490
Hey, everything you're saying is—

00:16:41.490 --> 00:16:42.210
That's enough.

00:16:43.780 --> 00:16:45.670
That's enough, Zoroku...

00:16:46.400 --> 00:16:50.490
I think it's true that I'm a monster!

00:16:50.490 --> 00:16:52.710
There are lots of things I 
thought were strange.

00:16:52.710 --> 00:16:53.420
Hey.

00:16:53.420 --> 00:16:55.250
I'm a monster.

00:16:55.800 --> 00:16:59.890
If you find out what I really am, 
I'm sure you'll hate me, too.

00:17:00.310 --> 00:17:03.160
M-Maybe you already hate me now.

00:17:05.900 --> 00:17:07.680
I don't want you or Sanae

00:17:07.680 --> 00:17:11.190
to go through any more 
trouble because of me.

00:17:11.190 --> 00:17:12.140
Hey, Sana...

00:17:12.140 --> 00:17:16.110
If it was all because I 
wanted to be human,

00:17:16.760 --> 00:17:19.350
then you don't... need me around.

00:17:20.410 --> 00:17:22.120
I'm sorry, Zoroku.

00:17:22.120 --> 00:17:24.980
I'll go back to the research facility.

00:17:25.550 --> 00:17:26.670
Thank you...

00:17:27.570 --> 00:17:29.360
The food was delicious!

00:17:36.060 --> 00:17:36.640
Yes!

00:17:36.640 --> 00:17:38.110
I'm taking a helicopter there!

00:17:38.110 --> 00:17:39.030
You?

00:17:39.240 --> 00:17:40.410
<i>I'll go on my own.</i>

00:17:40.410 --> 00:17:42.160
<i>That'll be faster.</i>

00:17:43.300 --> 00:17:46.810
Senpai, you're so awesome!

00:17:48.360 --> 00:17:50.790
I found out which boat they're on.

00:17:51.180 --> 00:17:53.550
Ichijo-kun will save them in no time.

00:17:53.550 --> 00:17:54.880
O-Okay.

00:17:55.140 --> 00:17:56.860
It'll be fine, really.

00:17:56.860 --> 00:18:00.780
Right now, I bet your grandpa's 
lecturing the kidnapper.

00:18:00.780 --> 00:18:04.440
He's saying, "I hate crooked stuff!"

00:18:10.170 --> 00:18:11.570
Back then...

00:18:12.260 --> 00:18:14.480
What're you making?

00:18:14.480 --> 00:18:17.610
They're graves.

00:18:18.390 --> 00:18:21.850
I don't clearly remember

00:18:22.410 --> 00:18:24.890
what Grandpa said to me then.

00:18:24.890 --> 00:18:26.140
But...

00:18:27.550 --> 00:18:32.130
Earlier, when he said that Sana-chan 
might become part of our family,

00:18:32.640 --> 00:18:37.160
I had a really strange feeling, 
like something

00:18:37.160 --> 00:18:39.050
tightening in my chest.

00:18:40.470 --> 00:18:41.620
And...

00:18:45.490 --> 00:18:48.180
I think that it made me 
remember a little bit.

00:18:48.620 --> 00:18:52.330
What Grandpa told me back then,

00:18:52.330 --> 00:18:54.670
at the time of my parents' funeral.

00:18:55.200 --> 00:18:58.940
And how much his words saved me.

00:18:58.940 --> 00:19:01.570
Listen... Sana.

00:19:01.570 --> 00:19:04.790
Even if you aren't human, so what?

00:19:05.280 --> 00:19:06.870
Don't say such dumb things.

00:19:11.290 --> 00:19:13.680
Just come home with me now, Sana.

00:19:16.950 --> 00:19:19.420
You said your name's Miriam-san?

00:19:19.420 --> 00:19:22.600
You said this girl isn't human.

00:19:23.370 --> 00:19:24.470
Then, let me ask...

00:19:24.470 --> 00:19:26.170
What is a human?

00:19:26.750 --> 00:19:29.760
You shot a child, without a 
thought. Are you human?

00:19:30.630 --> 00:19:32.770
That is not the issue here.

00:19:33.260 --> 00:19:35.970
You're right that this girl's dangerous.

00:19:35.970 --> 00:19:39.040
The moment I take my eyes off her, 
she's causing a commotion.

00:19:39.040 --> 00:19:41.070
At best, she's a nuisance.

00:19:41.750 --> 00:19:45.760
But everyone does those things.

00:19:45.760 --> 00:19:48.960
As long as you see the problem 
and improve, it's fine.

00:19:49.390 --> 00:19:50.960
That's all there is to it.

00:19:50.960 --> 00:19:52.370
Not to mention,

00:19:52.790 --> 00:19:55.120
she's happy when she has good food.

00:19:55.120 --> 00:19:57.590
In her own clumsy way, 
she worries about others.

00:19:57.590 --> 00:19:59.050
And she even gauges others' moods.

00:19:59.510 --> 00:20:01.380
Even when she's caused trouble,

00:20:01.380 --> 00:20:04.550
she's never done anything 
with malicious intent.

00:20:05.320 --> 00:20:07.330
That's who Sana is.

00:20:07.330 --> 00:20:09.020
She's got a heart.

00:20:09.480 --> 00:20:13.810
As I was saying, the issue here 
is not such a personal matter.

00:20:13.810 --> 00:20:17.160
You aren't in any position 
to do anything with her—

00:20:17.160 --> 00:20:19.400
Listen when your elders speak!

00:20:19.930 --> 00:20:23.850
All of us, no matter who, 
are imperfect somehow.

00:20:23.850 --> 00:20:26.920
There are things we can't know 
or do on our own,

00:20:26.920 --> 00:20:30.490
so we lean on each other to get by.

00:20:30.930 --> 00:20:32.830
Isn't that true for you, too?

00:20:33.820 --> 00:20:38.840
Look, even if this girl is some 
kind of alien, like you say,

00:20:38.840 --> 00:20:41.280
is that really a problem?

00:20:41.800 --> 00:20:45.140
You honestly don't think 
coexistence is possible?

00:20:48.200 --> 00:20:50.270
H-Hey, Zoroku...

00:20:50.590 --> 00:20:51.960
What are you saying?

00:20:51.960 --> 00:20:54.730
I'm not human, you know.

00:20:54.730 --> 00:20:57.830
I'll cause a lot of trouble for you.

00:20:57.830 --> 00:20:59.440
For Sanae, too.

00:21:00.230 --> 00:21:02.080
So what?

00:21:02.080 --> 00:21:03.850
No matter what you are,

00:21:03.850 --> 00:21:06.490
in tough times, you should 
be with others.

00:21:08.800 --> 00:21:10.450
Don't force yourself, Sana.

00:21:11.050 --> 00:21:17.300
In any case, I have no reason to send 
you away with these violent fools!

00:21:18.080 --> 00:21:21.580
You left because you wanted to 
see what was outside, right?

00:21:22.220 --> 00:21:23.940
Then do that.

00:21:23.940 --> 00:21:25.470
Don't go back on your word.

00:21:25.950 --> 00:21:29.420
I hate crooked stuff, you know.

00:21:37.600 --> 00:21:39.780
Y-You must be an idiot!

00:21:39.780 --> 00:21:40.740
I see.

00:21:49.520 --> 00:21:51.120
Sorry I'm late.

00:21:52.760 --> 00:21:54.430
I'm here to save you.

00:21:55.080 --> 00:21:59.800
I'm Cabinet Information Research Office 
Secret Service agent Ichijo Shizuku.

00:22:00.800 --> 00:22:03.970
We'll be taking you two with us!

00:23:35.010 --> 00:23:40.020
Next Episode 
A Home to Return to

00:23:35.890 --> 00:23:37.180
A Home to Return to.
